{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/extras/155633809927c5480a29e49e2d26501b.avif?t=1773291353\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/extras/30528f11a93b7e97b78610b2fbd930be.poster.avif?t=1773291353\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/extras/30528f11a93b7e97b78610b2fbd930be.webm?t=1773291353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/extras/30528f11a93b7e97b78610b2fbd930be.mp4?t=1773291353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goldanniyatech</strong> is an <strong>Action-Adventure</strong> game set in a <strong>Mini Open World</strong>, entirely crafted from scratch by myself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore the <strong>Golden planet</strong> and fight against a sudden surge of fantastical monsters threatening its people and the planet\u2019s harmony. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little by little, you will uncover the hidden truth behind these mysterious creatures and realize that this battle is far more dangerous than you ever imagined!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Note: Gameplay trailers coming soon!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/extras/7123abb0240fbd4b6b5f0f7599bdadad.avif?t=1773291353\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start this adventure as <strong>Charlotte</strong>, a powerful psychic with unique magical powers, or <strong>Max</strong>, a magic motorcycle enthusiast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>fantastical creatures</strong> like a stylized pegasus, a gigantic pumpkin or giant butterflies! Master new spells and defeat these monsters across the city, from parks and haunted buildings to the intergalactic resort park!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/extras/d9a1f00470ee2ed6004107d256c4bbad.avif?t=1773291353\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the beginning, you can choose between <strong>Charlotte</strong> and her brother <strong>Max</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your <strong>adventure progresses, </strong>you will <strong>unlock new heroes </strong>by completing each <strong>Destiny Quest </strong>to help you through your journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/extras/1b4b7beaa4e9fd81274aebd97721a0f7.avif?t=1773291353\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>every store</strong> across the city to <strong>buy powerful upgrades</strong> for your heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/extras/3286ce1e662679144d20e7fd3c530819.avif?t=1773291353\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roam freely </strong>through a small yet richly detailed<strong> urban world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/extras/9da2d168125fafbba592d677109c63f5.avif?t=1773291353\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 </strong>Begin your journey with<strong> Charlotte </strong>(Psychic) or <strong>Max </strong>as the firsts<strong> Playable Characters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Battle </strong>waves of <strong>enemies</strong> in the<strong> Training Area </strong>to sharpen your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Buy </strong>and <strong>drive </strong>a variety of<strong> vehicles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Level up </strong>and evolve your <strong>characters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Features will expand over time </strong>as development continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/extras/509ea716e5a7fb1e10f90fb67c26a6bf.avif?t=1773291353\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free demo</strong> will be released before the <strong>Early Access</strong> version and will <strong>continue to evolve</strong> alongside the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to <strong>play</strong> <strong>the first Destiny Quest</strong> as <strong>Charlotte</strong> or <strong>Max</strong>, slightly <strong>upgrade</strong> their skills, and <strong>drive</strong> two vehicles: Cerulean Racer and Amber.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add my game to your wishlist today and prepare for an unforgettable adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585280?t=1773291353","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585280?t=1773291353","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/88822a8e51c3e01a4ba6385bc5a54151905fa8d